            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "Retro, 90’s style rock’n diamonds with logic gates/binary puzzles. Fail to succeed. Dodge gravity balls. Collect items to unlock the exit. Use logic gates to solve puzzles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Something old</h2>The ecstatic pleasure of winning when you failed so many times in order to beat the challenge.<br>The exasperation when the game gets the best of you when you’re least expecting.<br>The kick-up from the ramping progression.<br>The nostalgic 8 bit retro sound.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Something new</h2>These tightly packed old-school levels add a new challenge: LOGIC GATES.  <br>Use logic operations (“AND”, “OR”, “NOR”, “XOR”, etc) presented in an accessible manner.<br>Manipulate 19 functional tiles (signal generators, sensors, timers, delays, teleporters, etc).<br>Avoid lurking viruses and over-zealous anti-malware<br>Open laser barriers<br>Turn off lethal electric arcs<br><br><br>What others say about CompliKATed:<br><br><i>“This is like a maze where the walls move in” </i> - BasketMC on Mixer<br><i>“This game is fast becoming my favorite non-horror game”</i> - Shanon Gower on Youtube<br><i>“There's a surprising amount of thinking involved in these tightly-packed levels”</i> -  Liam Dawe on <br><i>“That was insanely difficult […] but we did it! We beat the level!”</i>  - MagicManMo on Youtube",
