                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "My first game played was Supaplex and I thought I'll never ever play a clone of it with the same pleasure. But this is indeed very nice and it has unique complex levels.\nPro's\n- I do like that I got to learn logic operators\n- I totally love the fox, super cute to look at \n- I enjoy the music\n\nCon's\n- More levels - like a free DLC would be nice\n- Preferable an editor - so I can make my own crazy levels\n\nKeep it up!",
